#: ../../tools/epidemiology_tools.rst:32 c86ac880d1a447f294b5fea363be3031
msgid ""
"**Description**: Compute post-test probability via Bayes' theorem given "
"pre-test prevalence, test sensitivity, and specificity. Converts "
"prevalence to pre-test odds, applies likelihood ratio (LR+ for positive "
"test, LR- for negative test), and converts post-test odds back to "
"probability. Useful for interpreting test results in clinical settings."
msgstr ""

