#: ../../tools/epidemiology_tools.rst:164 9a0a331ea62b48c5ac58e7aead0f8c24
msgid ""
"**Description**: Compute herd immunity threshold and effective "
"reproduction number from R0 and vaccine efficacy. Returns the perfect-"
"vaccine threshold (1-1/R0), the VE-adjusted minimum vaccination coverage "
"(Vc = threshold/VE), and optionally Re at a given coverage fraction. "
"Useful for vaccine program planning and outbreak assessment."
msgstr ""

